{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And great avodah.</b> Great produce — in the language of לע\"ז אוברי\"נא. עֲבוֹדָה means a single act of work; עֲבֻדָּה means much produce."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The la'az אוברי\"נא corresponds to Old French oevreine / ovrine, 'work, yield, produce'."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:37.436365662Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}